Setup Guide: Orion Calculator PWA
​Prerequisites
​GitHub Repository (Public)
​Google Cloud Project (or Apps Script Access)
​Yoco Merchant Account (Test/Live Keys)
​Deployment Steps
​1. Frontend (GitHub Pages)
​Ensure the following file structure exists:
​Pricing/index.html
​Pricing/manifest.json
​Pricing/sw.js
​Pricing/404.html
​Update the manifest.json start_url to "./index.html".
​In index.html, ensure the BACKEND_URL constant points to your deployed Google Web App URL.
​Enable GitHub Pages in Repo Settings -> Source: main branch.
​2. Backend (Google Apps Script)
​Create a new Google Sheet.
​Open Extensions > Apps Script.
​Paste the backend code (Code.gs).
​Set Script Properties:
​YOCO_SECRET_KEY: sk_test_... (or live key)
​SHEET_ID: 1FZx_uWK2ZBRcZi8gWgqFGQNbh4xkbWicwCxW0PgQXDA
​Deploy as Web App -> Execute as "Me" -> Access: "Anyone".
​3. Testing
​Open the hosted URL on a mobile device.
​Test the "Add to Home Screen" prompt.
​Run a test transaction (Order ID should appear in Google Sheets).
​Troubleshooting
​CORS Errors: Ensure the GAS Web App is deployed with Access set to "Anyone".
​Signature Pad Issues: Ensure touch-action: none is present in CSS for mobile scrolling prevention.